  "text": "Planning Document: docs/dcps/INNERWEST/Marrickville/Marrickville DCP 2011 - 9 13 Henson Park.pdf\n\nClause 9.13.2 - heritage (development_control): To protect and preserve the identified period buildings within the precinct and encourage their sympathetic alteration  or restoration.\n\nClause 9.13.2 - heritage (development_control): To protect the identified Heritage Items  within the precinct.\n\nClause 9.13.2 - height_limit (development_control): To maintain distinctly single storey streetscapes that exist within the precinct.\n\nClause 9.13.2 - heritage (development_control): To protect groups or runs of buildings which retain their original built form including roof fo rms, original detailing and finishes.\n\nClause 9.13.2 - heritage (development_control): To protect  significant streetscape s and/or public domain elements within the precinct including landscaping, fencing, open space, sandstone kerbing and guttering, views and vistas and prevailing subdivision patterns.\n\nClause 9.13.2 - zoning (development_control): To preserve the predominantly low density residen tial character of the precinct.\n\nClause 9.13.2 - parking (development_control): To ensure that the provision and location of off -street car parking does not adversely impact the amenity of the precinct.\n\nClause 9.13.2 - heritage (development_control): To protect the identified values of the Audley Street South (Bayswater Estate) Heritage Conservation Area and the Norwood Park Estate  Heritage Conservation Area.\n\n",
